---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Legal" description="Invoice Ninja legal information and policies." path="/legal/">
  <Header slot="header" />

  <section class="py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-8">Legal</h1>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <a href="/terms/" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-1">Terms of Service</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Conditions of use for Invoice Ninja.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-1">Privacy Policy</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">How we collect, use, and protect your data.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/gdpr/" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-1">GDPR Compliance</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Your rights under the General Data Protection Regulation.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/self-hosting-terms-service/" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-1">Self-Hosting Terms</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Terms for self-hosted Invoice Ninja installations.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/self-hosting-privacy-data-control/" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-1">Self-Hosting Privacy & Data Control</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Privacy information for self-hosted users.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/pci/" class="block p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-primary/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark mb-1">PCI Compliance</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Payment Card Industry compliance information.</p>
        </a>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-dark mt-16 mb-6">Legal Compliance & Standards</h2>
      <div class="space-y-8">

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">ESIGN Act</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">The Electronic Signatures in Global and National Commerce Act is a U.S. law from 2000 that grants legal validity to electronic signatures and records, ensuring they are as enforceable as handwritten signatures on paper documents.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">UETA Act</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">The Uniform Electronic Transactions Act is a model law adopted by many U.S. states. It establishes that electronic records and signatures are legally equivalent to paper documents and handwritten signatures.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">SOC 2 Type 2</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2">This audit demonstrates several key commitments:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-600 space-y-1">
            <li>Data privacy and cybersecurity compliance dedication</li>
            <li>Foundational security and compliance program establishment</li>
            <li>Year-over-year benchmarking for governance monitoring</li>
            <li>Customer and partner relationship compliance assurance</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">eIDAS</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Electronic Identification, Authentication and Trust Services is an EU regulation enabling individuals and businesses to use their national digital identities (eIDs) and electronic signatures for online transactions in any other EU country.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-2">HIPAA Compliance</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">A HIPAA Compliant eSignature solution meets healthcare industry standards and includes secure authentication, encryption, audit trails, and compliance documentation to meet HIPAA's legal and regulatory requirements for safeguarding protected health information (PHI).</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
